OL,3,GNEWSABurnham's devolution plan won't
OL,4,Awork in Wales, former Labour minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham's call for
OL,8,Fgovernments to hand more powers down to
OL,9,Fregions and cities "just doesn't work"
OL,10,Fin Wales, a former Welsh government
OL,11,Fminister has said.
OL,13,FLee Waters is one of two ex-Labour
OL,14,Fministers who have criticised the UK
OL,15,Fgovernment's push for Wales to hand
OL,16,Fmore powers to local councils.
OL,18,FThe other, Alun Davies, accused his
OL,19,FLabour colleagues in Westminster of
OL,20,Fputting him through "hell" when he
OL,21,Ftried to reform councils in 2018.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
