OL,3,GNEWSABurnham's devolution plan won't
OL,4,Awork in Wales, former Labour minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FBurnham appealed to Welsh and Scottish
OL,8,Fgovernments for "deeper devolution"
OL,9,Fwhen he met their first ministers last
OL,10,Fweek, and said the UK's four nations
OL,11,Fmust "move together" to devolve more to
OL,12,Fregions and cities.
